## `drop_na()`: removing missingness from all variables in the dataset

- `drop_na()` removes rows with missing data
  - You can target specific columns, or drop any row with any missingness


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
hrs_01_na_rm <- hrs_00 |>
  drop_na()
tibble(hrs_01_na_rm)
```

